  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the respin of the avatar menu the compact menu option has been removed. It's still available for the world menu, however.\n\nThe compact menu is crucial for us with many uploaded avatars, at least as long as we lack a proper search feature. Please do not remove it.\n\nFirst two screenshots are open beta, last two are stable.\n\nP.S.\n\nAnother, albeit very minor, regression is that I can no longer tell how many avatars are in my \"Uploaded\" category on the side tab.\n\nIt's also no longer possible to switch avatar category/folder when using the 4 columns/row mode when collapsing the left-hand side bar.",
